  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Offre de soins de sant&#xe9; d&#x2019;urgence critique pour les personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es internes et leurs communaut&#xe9;s h&#xf4;tes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health assistance to vulnerable communities affected by conflict-related displacement in Ouahigouya, Boulsa, Kongoussi, and Bogande. This WHO project provides support to managing malnutrition cases, newborn and childhood illness, as well as the distribution of dignity kits. The project supports 170,000 people, including 40,800 women, 32,300 men, 96,900 children, and 6,800 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
